msgctxt "80"
msgid "I never thought I'd live to see the day my Masahiko treated me to a meal!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "92"
msgid ""
"What are you talking about, Granny? This won't be the last time the grub'll "
"be on me!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "104"
msgid "I'll go pay. You two wait here."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "164"
msgid ""
"Thanks so much for today. It was so nice of you to play along with "
"Masahiko's little white lie."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "176"
msgid "Huh...?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "188"
msgid "Oh, I know, all right. I know he was lying to me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "200"
msgid ""
"But he's trying so darn hard to please me, it's hard for me to be mad at "
"him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "212"
msgid "Sorry. Guess I blew it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "224"
msgid ""
"Here, take this souvenir from my hometown. It's a small gesture of thanks "
"from an old woman."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "236"
msgid "You got a <Color:8>Sushi Set<Color:Default>."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "272"
msgid ""
"This is yours, too. You covered Masahiko's debt, didn't you? Thank you for "
"that. I've added a little⑬for your trouble."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "284"
msgid "You got <Color:8>110,000 yen<Color:Default>."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "308"
msgid "Well, the bill's all paid. Shall we move on to our next destination?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "320"
msgid ""
"Sir, I have some work to attend to. You and your grandmother will have to "
"go on without me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "332"
msgid "Huh...? But..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "440"
msgid "(You be the best grandson you can be. Got it?)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "452"
msgid "(Yes, sir...)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "476"
msgid "I never thought I'd live to see the day my Masahiko treated me to a meal!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "488"
msgid ""
"What are you talking about, Granny? This won't be the last time the grub'll "
"be on me!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "500"
msgid "But, you know... it's not nice to lie."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "512"
msgid "Huh!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "524"
msgid "I've known all along you were no company president."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "536"
msgid ""
"And you had to go and bring this nice Kiryu-san into it, too. He probably "
"cried until you gave in, right? He's always done that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "548"
msgid "No..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "560"
msgid ""
"You don't have to be a big shot CEO for me, Masahiko. Just live an honest "
"life, and a happy one. That's good enough for your old granny."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "572"
msgid "Granny... I..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "584"
msgid "I think my job is done here."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "596"
msgid "Kiryu-san... Thank you for helping me today."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "608"
msgid ""
"I really did enjoy myself. Here. Won't you take this? It's a souvenir from "
"my hometown."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "620"
msgid "You got a <Color:8>Sushi Set<Color:Default>."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "656"
msgid ""
"This is yours, too. You covered Masahiko's debt, didn't you? Thank you for "
"that. I've added a little⑬for your trouble."
msgstr ""

